  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 528.05 Transfer to Another DRF. A person who so consents may be transferred from one DRF to another for the purpose of being conditionally discharged. Such a transfer shall be in accordance with He-M 529 and RSA 171-B:15, II.\n\nSource. #6215, eff 3-30-96, EXPIRED: 12-31-98\n\nNew. #7063, eff 7-24-99, EXPIRED: 7-24-07\n\nNew. #9061, eff 1-3-08; ss by #11009, INTERIM, eff 1-3-16, EXPIRES: 7-1-16; ss by #11125, eff 7-1-16",
